flowchart TD
 A([Start])-->B[Enter recipient, amount and source]
 B-->C{Input valid?}
 C--no-->B
 C--yes-->D[Send request with idempotency key]
 D-->E{Key already exists?}
 E--yes-->R[Return original transfer]
 E--no-->F[Lock wallet and run validation chain]
 F-->G{Rules pass?}
 G--no-->X[Typed error; no debit]
 G--yes-->H[Create INITIATED then PROCESSING]
 H-->I[Authorize payment strategy]
 I-->J{Authorized?}
 J--no-->K[FAILED; reconcile or refund]
 J--yes-->L[Append ledger entry]
 L-->M[SUCCESS and notify]
 R-->Z([Show result])
 X-->Z
 K-->Z
 M-->Z
